# Fit reports are run artifacts: one per model_run, describing a posterior that
# exists only in someone's local solverah_modeldev database. Committing them
# would put numbers in the repo that nothing else can reproduce or check.
#
# Kept as a .gitignore INSIDE the directory rather than a line in the repo root's,
# so this package stays self-contained and nobody has to remember the rule lives
# somewhere else.
*
!.gitignore
